{'symbol': 'CMI', 'date': '2021-09-23 07:30:00', 'title': 'CUMMINS RECEIVES AWARD FROM THE UK GOVERNMENT TO ACCELERATE HYDROGEN ENGINE DEVELOPMENT FOR MEDIUM AND HEAVY-DUTY ENGINES', 'text': "COLUMBUS, IND.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CUMMINS INC. (NYSE: CMI) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS HYDROGEN-FUELED INTERNAL COMBUSTION ENGINE (H2-ICE) PROGRAM IS BEGINNING DEVELOPMENT OF A MEDIUM-DUTY 6.7-LITER AND A HEAVY-DUTY 15-LITER ENGINE. “WE'VE ESTABLISHED SIGNIFICANT GOALS AS PART OF OUR PLANET 2050 SUSTAINABILITY STRATEGY, INCLUDING A TARGET OF ZERO EMISSIONS,” SAID SRIKANTH PADMANABHAN, PRESIDENT, ENGINE BUSINESS, CUMMINS INC. “REDUCING WELL-TO-WHEELS CARBON EMISSIONS REQUIRES INNOVATION OF BOTH ENER"}